    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. one last thing—can you mention how these scaling methods handle sudden, unpredictable spikes in traffic? like if we get hit with a massive influx of users all at once, which method is more reactive and why? i want to wrap up the brief with a clear recommendation on which one prevents us from being overwhelmed.",
